      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Also pointing out for people who forgot that there is still no way to see what your avatar looks like when people use different safety settings. \nThere needs to be separate options for performance and safety settings for players to toggle what they want on their own avatar. This would also allow creators to test and visualise the worst cases when things are blocked or disabled.",
